[ti:The Marines' Hymn]
[ar:Traditional]
[01:30.00]From the halls of Montezuma
[01:30.25]To the shores of Tripoli
[01:30.50]We will fight our country's battles
[01:30.75]In the air, on land, and sea
[01:31.00]First to fight for right and freedom
[01:31.25]And to keep our honor clean
[01:31.50]We are proud to claim the title
[01:31.75]Of United States Marine
